      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MINH ARDIE (1) jumped quickly from box six to score (24.37) two back then drew the same last time but settled off pace and could manage only a 11 length 5th at Shepparton (26.40). Has won two of three starts from this draw. Has ability and can bounce back. JUST ANGELIC (8) was unwanted in betting when starting from the same box but ran very well, finishing in the minors over 400m at this track in a Grade 5 in 23.17. Expecting another bold showing. IT'S FRIDAY (2) struggled in tougher grade last start after drifting back at Traralgon, but prior to that won easily by 4.5 lengths at this track (23.09) beating Warrior Tommy in a Grade 5 on August 6. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. WHIZBANG JOSIE (7) can feature with the right run.",
